{"id":"a6d73b681e650638","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md","title":"Ordinal Definable Set","display":"df-ordinal-definable — Ordinal Definable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ordinal-definable","aliases":["58-df-ordinal-definable"],"display":"df-ordinal-definable — Ordinal Definable Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-free-variable]]","[[58-df-transitive-closure]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ordinal-definable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ordinal-definable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal-definable — Ordinal Definable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"58-df-transitive-closure\">58-df-transitive-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{M}=\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak{M}=\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\)</span> (set-coded transitive structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\alpha\\in(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M)^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec\\alpha\\in(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M)^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> (finite ordinal-parameter sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\{\\in\\}}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\{\\in\\}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\{\\in\\}}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\{\\in\\}}(\\varphi)\\)</span> (formula and free-variable operator)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[x,\\vec\\alpha]\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[x,\\vec\\alpha]\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[x,\\vec\\alpha]\">\\((\\mathsf V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[x,\\vec\\alpha]\\)</span> (metatheoretic satisfaction)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}\\)</span> (transitive-closure operator)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OD}_S,\\mathrm{OD}^{\\mathfrak M}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OD}_S,\\mathrm{OD}^{\\mathfrak M}_S\\)</span> (ordinal-definability predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HOD}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HOD}_S\\)</span> (hereditary ordinal-definability predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OD},\\mathrm{HOD}\">\\(\\mathrm{OD},\\mathrm{HOD}\\)</span> (class variables defined here) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> (class predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (序数类)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable\\text{-}in\\text{-}a\\text{-}structure} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{OD}^{\\mathfrak M}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow M\\in V\\land\\mathfrak M=\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\land\\forall z\\in M\\;(z\\subseteq M)\\land x\\in M\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\{\\in\\}}\\;\\exists\\vec\\alpha\\in(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M)^n\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\{\\in\\}}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\land\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[x,\\vec\\alpha]\\land\\forall y\\in M\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[y,\\vec\\alpha]\\to y=x)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable\\text{-}in\\text{-}a\\text{-}structure} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{OD}^{\\mathfrak M}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow M\\in V\\land\\mathfrak M=\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\land\\forall z\\in M\\;(z\\subseteq M)\\land x\\in M\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\{\\in\\}}\\;\\exists\\vec\\alpha\\in(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M)^n\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\{\\in\\}}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\land\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[x,\\vec\\alpha]\\land\\forall y\\in M\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[y,\\vec\\alpha]\\to y=x)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{OD}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\{\\in\\}}\\;\\exists\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}^n\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\{\\in\\}}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\land(\\mathsf V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[x,\\vec\\alpha]\\land\\forall y\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\mathsf V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[y,\\vec\\alpha]\\to y=x\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{OD}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\{\\in\\}}\\;\\exists\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}^n\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\{\\in\\}}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_n\\}\\land(\\mathsf V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[x,\\vec\\alpha]\\land\\forall y\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\mathsf V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[y,\\vec\\alpha]\\to y=x\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{HOD}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\operatorname{TC}(\\{x\\})\\;\\mathrm{OD}_S(y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{HOD}_S(x)\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\operatorname{TC}(\\{x\\})\\;\\mathrm{OD}_S(y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}od\\text{-}hod\\text{-}classes} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Class}_S(\\mathrm{OD})\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\mathrm{HOD})\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\mathrm{OD}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{OD}_S(x)\\bigr)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\mathrm{HOD}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HOD}_S(x)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}od\\text{-}hod\\text{-}classes} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Class}_S(\\mathrm{OD})\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\mathrm{HOD})\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\mathrm{OD}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{OD}_S(x)\\bigr)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\mathrm{HOD}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HOD}_S(x)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>唯一性子句是“由序数参数定义”不可省略的部分；仅满足某个含序数参数的公式不足以定义对象。</li>\n<li>绝对的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OD}\">\\(\\mathrm{OD}\\)</span> 使用真宇宙上的元理论满足关系，而不是“在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\theta\">\\(V_\\theta\\)</span> 中唯一可定义”；后者一般不是全局序数可定义性的等价刻画。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OD}\">\\(\\mathrm{OD}\\)</span> 是可序数定义集合的类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HOD}\">\\(\\mathrm{HOD}\\)</span> 是其遗传版本；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HOD}\">\\(\\mathrm{HOD}\\)</span> 是 ZF 的可定义内模型并满足选择公理。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{HOD}\\subseteq\\mathrm{OD}\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{HOD}\\subseteq\\mathrm{OD}\\)</span>，但这些包含关系在一般 ZF 模型中不必严格；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 中三者均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive-closure","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed"